<section class="path" id="path"><div class="wrap"><div class="path-intro"><div class="eyebrow">The Dzogchen Path</div><h2>One Path, Taught in Order</h2><div class="rule"></div><p class="lead">Most students move through these five stages in sequence, live and in community, with Lama Michael guiding each person toward the right next step.</p></div>
 <div class="path-visual">
 <div class="steps" aria-label="The progressive stages of the Dzogchen teaching path">
  <article class="step step-start"><div class="step-image"><img src="images/path-mindfulness.webp" alt="Meditation cushion beside a still bowl of water" width="600" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="step-heading"><div class="num">01</div><h3>Mindfulness</h3></div><span class="step-hours">12h of teaching</span><p>The six-week foundation. Learn to watch the mind clearly before anything else.</p><a class="link step-cta" href="#free"><span>Begin Free</span><span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
  <article class="step"><div class="step-image"><img src="images/path-mahayana.webp" alt="Luminous lotus reflected on calm water" width="600" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="step-heading"><div class="num">02</div><h3>Mahayana Teachings</h3></div><span class="step-hours">52h of teaching</span><p>The path of compassion and bodhicitta, turning practice toward all beings.</p><a class="link step-cta" href="mahayana.html"><span>Explore Mahayana</span><span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
  <article class="step"><div class="step-image"><img src="images/path-tantra.webp" alt="Ritual bell and vajra in warm candlelight" width="600" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="step-heading"><div class="num">03</div><h3>Tantra Teachings</h3></div><span class="step-hours">48h of teaching</span><p>Skillful means. Live weekly with Lama Philip, for students who've taken empowerment.</p><a class="link step-cta" href="tantra.html"><span>Explore Tantra</span><span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
  <article class="step"><div class="step-image"><img src="images/path-dzogchen.webp" alt="Clear open sky above a spacious mountain horizon" width="600" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="step-heading"><div class="num">04</div><h3>Dzogchen Transmissions</h3></div><span class="step-hours">62h of teaching</span><p>The Lion Stops Hunting. Live Saturdays with Lama Chris Wilkinson: complete transmission of the Great Perfection Tantras.</p><a class="link step-cta" href="dzogchen-transmissions.html"><span>Discover Dzogchen</span><span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
  <article class="step membership-step"><div class="step-image"><img src="images/path-complete.webp" alt="Streams of light converging into one mountain path" width="600" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="membership-badge">The path continues here</span></div><div class="membership-promo"><div class="step-heading"><h3>The Complete Teachings</h3></div><span class="step-hours step-hours-included">Included in the Membership</span><p>Follow the complete path - from Buddhist foundations and Mahayana to Vajrayana, Mahamudra, and Dzogchen - within one guided membership. Learn live, return to the recordings anytime, and deepen your practice alongside experienced teachers and a committed Sangha.</p><ul class="membership-benefits" aria-label="Membership highlights"><li>Complete staged curriculum</li><li>Live teachings and Q&amp;A</li><li>Full on-demand library</li><li>Practice community and support</li></ul><div class="membership-promo-action"><span class="membership-price">Membership from <strong>$149</strong><small>/month</small></span><a class="btn gold" href="membership.html">Discover the Complete Path <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></article>
 </div></div>
 <p class="path-note">Not sure where you'd start? Begin with the free Mindfulness course above. Lama Michael personally points every student toward their next step from there.</p>
